# Pinned inputs for the Z240 build (sourced by scripts/fetch-sources.sh).
#
# The dry run and the final build read this same file, so a dry run that passes
# describes exactly what the final build will compile.
#
# A value is a full commit SHA (reproducible) or a branch name such as "main"
# (tip at run time; the commit actually used is written to sources.txt in the logs).
#
# Tips of each default branch on 2026-11-02:
